{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Overview:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A survival horror game inspired by the great PS1 era classics. A blend of third person action, exploration, with\u00a0light puzzle solving elements.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445380/extras/GAME_OVERVIEW.gif?t=1741741074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive the trauma</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something has transformed Lake Forest Academy. Its classrooms tell a story of terror and mystery. Its monsters a reflection of people's nightmares.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445380/extras/SURVIVE_THE_TRAUMA.gif?t=1741741074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combat the horrors</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outsmart depraved creatures. Find a variety of weapons and items to help you venture deeper into the darkness. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445380/extras/COMBAT_THE_HORRORS.gif?t=1741741074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endure deadly traps</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll be put in dangerous situations. Think hard and you may endure. Something doesn't want you here.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445380/extras/ENDURE_DEADLY_TRAPS.gif?t=1741741074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unravel dark history</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The pieces were in front of everyone the whole time. Someone worked hard to hide the truth.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445380/extras/DARK_HISTORY.gif?t=1741741074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You'll soon learn that Amy didn't die here. Something Took Her, but why...?</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple weapons with unique characteristics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple environments to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat techniques that spice up the genre</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2+ Hour runtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-crafted cutscenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3445380?t=1741741074","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3445380?t=1741741074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445380/c23376abf5395d305a176a5a5b9c450a4da57ea7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741741074","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445380/c23376abf5395d305a176a5a5b9c450a4da57ea7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741741074","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Depiction of Alcohol use\r\nStylized depictions of gore and violence\r\nSome Mature Language\r\nMention of Sexual Assault"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Overview:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A survival horror game inspired by the great PS1 era classics. A blend of third person act