41074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You'll soon learn that Amy didn't die here. Something Took Her, but why...?</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple weapons with unique characteristics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple environments to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat techniques that spice up the genre</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2+ Hour runtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-crafted cutscenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p>","developers":["Retrobot"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445380/1de4e253a6772d6b01f010ca9216b56f65e342c5/header.jpg?t=1741741074","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112105,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112105/movie480.mp4?t=1741733192","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112105/movie_max.mp4?t=1741733192"},"name":"Something Took Her | Official Annoucement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257112105/282e6b41a1fd2024347fdf4ef0d5809271eccc61/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741733192","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112105/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741733192","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112105/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741733192"}}],"name":"Something Took Her","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core Duo Q8300 @ 2.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memor